WEBVTT

00:17:56.903 --> 00:18:00.476
that actively embraces
innovative and sustainable design

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:03.473
to improve the living
conditions for everyone.

00:18:03.497 --> 00:18:05.815
Chris Anderson: Wait a sec --
that's your wish?

00:18:05.839 --> 00:18:06.990
CS: That's my wish.

00:18:07.014 --> 00:18:08.165
CA: That's his wish!

00:18:08.189 --> 00:18:14.712
(Applause)

00:18:21.303 --> 00:18:25.152
CS: We started Architecture for Humanity
with 700 dollars and a website.

00:18:25.707 --> 00:18:29.426
So Chris somehow decided
to give me 100,000.

00:18:29.783 --> 00:18:31.608
So why not this many people?